{title: Circle Of Women}
{artist: Unknown}

Women

    May all mothers know that they
    are loved



    and may all sisters know that they
    are strong

    and may all daughters know that
    they are worthy/beautiful/powerful
    that the circle of women may live
    on
    that the fire of the goddess may

burn on!
Wehaheya Wehaheya Wehahe
Wehaheya
